          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this model is reduced to 0 wounds, roll a dice. On a 2+ it Explodes, and each unit within 2D6&quot; suffers D6 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
