          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, then for each Detachment in your army, you cannon include more TAUROX PRIME models in that Detachment than there are MILITARUM TEMPESTUS INFANTRY units in that Detachment.</characteristic>
